123 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Founded in 2009, Synergy is a student-driven business society committed to bridging the divide between academic learning and real-world corporate exposure. We believe that classroom knowledge reaches its full potential only when applied in practice, and hence, our efforts are focused on equipping members with both intellectual and professional skills. )
/Pg 9 0 R
>>
endobj
124 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (As a member-centric platform, Synergy nurtures aspiring leaders by fostering growth opportunities across diverse domains such as Consulting, Finance, Marketing, and Entrepreneurship. We enable members to work on live projects with startups, corporates, and organizations, ensuring hands-on exposure that sharpens analytical and problem-solving abilities. Alongside, our curated workshops, speaker sessions with industry executives, and training programs strengthen technical and soft skills.)
/Pg 9 0 R
>>
endobj
125 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Each year, our flagship management conclave attracts participants from across India, challenging them with competitive simulations and case studies. In essence, Synergy serves as a launchpad for ambitious students, transforming them into industry-ready professionals.)
/Pg 9 0 R
>>
endobj
